CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F124A1786056988
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCReflections on 50th
OL,4,Canniversary of BBC TV News presentation
OL,5,Cupdate
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe 5.45pm bulletin, billed in Radio
OL,8,FTimes as the National News to
OL,9,Fdistinguish it from the regional news
OL,10,Fwhich followed but not branded with
OL,11,Fthis title on air, took up the name
OL,12,FEvening News. It was brought forward to
OL,13,F5.40pm six months later when ITN
OL,14,Flaunched the News at 5.45.
OL,16,FThe interesting thing about these
OL,17,Fchanges was that they seemed to be
OL,18,Fflowing against the tide.
OL,20,FWas too much attention being paid to
OL,21,Fthe pictures themselves at the expense
OL,22,Fof clear storytelling?
OL,23,APub: 08-Mar-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,125,120,200,300,0,100
