OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F124A1786056988
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G5/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCReflections on 50th
OL,4,Canniversary of BBC TV News presentation
OL,5,Cupdate
OL,6,
OL,7,FRemember this was an era before
OL,8,FElectronic News Gathering (ENG) was in
OL,9,Fuse and years before computer graphics.
OL,11,FFilm had to be processed and developed.
OL,13,FThe changes split Radio Times readers.
OL,14,FSome welcomed them, others saw them as
OL,15,Fa step backwards.
OL,17,FToday lightweight equipment, advanced
OL,18,Fcomputer graphics, satellite and the
OL,19,Finternet make it immeasurably easier to
OL,20,Ftry to make the news visually
OL,21,Finteresting.
OL,23,APub: 08-Mar-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,125,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12406
SC,0006
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F124A1786056988
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G6/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCReflections on 50th
OL,4,Canniversary of BBC TV News presentation
OL,5,Cupdate
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut these tools can never be a
OL,8,Freplacement for clear writing, accuracy
OL,9,Fand good storytelling.
OL,11,FFashions come and go. Individual
OL,12,Feditors have preferences.
OL,14,FBut the building blocks of the best TV
OL,15,Fpackaging are timeless.
OL,17,FModern technology should make it easier
OL,18,Fto harness the power of a visual medium
OL,19,Fto tell the day's news clearly without
OL,20,Feither resorting to gimmickry or ruling
OL,21,Fout important material because it could
OL,22,Fbe dull TV.
OL,23,APub: 08-Mar-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,125,120,200,300,0,100
